Third-party code in the framework-devtools plugin (RB-080-24)
==============================================================

The panels (panel/dist/react.js, panel/dist/vue.js) are built from web/src with the packages below bundled
in, unchanged, each under the MIT licence (https://opensource.org/license/mit). The matching
backends ride in rbrowser.exe (agent/dist/rb-react-devtools.js, rb-vue-devtools.js; see
packaging/NOTICE.in). The versions are pinned in web/package-lock.json and
agent/package-lock.json. The build writes the name, version and full licence text of every
bundled package to panel/dist/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt, which the plugin package carries.

